# Trivy accepted risks. Every entry needs a reason, a compensating control and a review trigger.
# Reviewed 2026-10-24. Revisit if the budget changes from Rs 0 or the app goes beyond demo traffic.

# AWS-0011 CloudFront without WAF: AWS WAF costs ~$5/month + per-request fees (breaks the Rs 0 budget).
# Compensating: AWS Shield Standard (free, automatic), app rate limiting (ADR-012), Lambda concurrency cap,
# CloudFront-only origin (X-Origin-Verify), AWS Budgets alert at $0.01.
AWS-0011

# AWS-0132 S3 SSE with a customer-managed KMS key: a CMK costs $1/month. The bucket holds only the public SPA build
# (no user data); SSE-S3 (AES-256) at rest + private bucket + CloudFront OAC is proportionate.
AWS-0132

# AWS-0010 CloudFront access logging: adds a log bucket and storage cost. Compensating: CloudFront's free
# standard metrics in CloudWatch, API request logs (JSON, request IDs) in CloudWatch Logs with 7-day retention.
AWS-0010
